diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..55a2066 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -105,3 +105,39 @@ knife ssh 'hostname:fizzy-lb-*' 'sudo docker exec fizzy-load-balancer kamal-prox
 ## License
 
 fizzy-saas is released under the [O'Saasy License](LICENSE.md).
+
+### Hosted billing configuration
+
+Billing uses Stripe-hosted Checkout and the customer portal. Configure these
+server-side environment variables (already named in the SaaS deploy secrets):
+
+- `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`
+- `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`
+- `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID`: a recurring USD $20/month price for Unlimited (5 GB)
+- `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID`: a recurring USD $25/month price for Unlimited+ (500 GB)
+
+Enable these two prices and subscription changes/cancellation in the Stripe
+customer portal. Register the **untenanted** endpoint `/stripe/webhooks` for
+`customer.subscription.created`, `customer.subscription.updated`, and
+`customer.subscription.deleted`. Checkout completion/return URLs do not grant
+access: signed subscription events do. Active and trialing subscriptions receive
+paid allowances; other statuses fall back to Free (1,000 published cards, 1 GB).
+Unknown prices never grant paid access. Retries and older event snapshots are
+ignored. Cancellation scheduled for period end retains the paid plan while the
+subscription remains active.
+
+Staff support tools are at `/admin/accounts`. Comp grants Unlimited without
+charging Stripe (it does not cancel an existing subscription). Usage overrides
+replace measured published-card count and/or bytes used; blank fields keep the
+measured value, and Reset removes the override. Drafts don't consume free cards.
+Existing storage exceptions continue to take precedence over plan storage.
+
+Offline regression tests (all Stripe API operations are mocked):
+
+```sh
+SAAS=true DATABASE_ADAPTER=sqlite RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails db:migrate
+SAAS=true DATABASE_ADAPTER=sqlite PARALLEL_WORKERS=1 bin/rails test \
+  saas/test/models/account/billing_test.rb \
+  saas/test/integration/billing_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/stripe/webhooks_controller_test.rb
+```
